sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Chat.tsx
  participant A as askQuestion action
  participant F as Firestore
  participant L as langchain.ts
  participant P as Pinecone
  participant O as OpenAI
  U->>C: types a follow-up question
  C->>C: push human turn and Thinking placeholder
  C->>A: askQuestion docId question
  A->>F: count human turns in chat subcollection
  A->>F: add human message
  A->>L: generateLangchainCompletion
  L->>P: describeIndexStats namespace exists
  L->>F: load chat history
  L->>O: rewrite question into standalone query
  L->>P: similarity search in docId namespace
  L->>O: answer with chunks and history
  L-->>A: reply.answer
  A->>F: add ai message
  F-->>C: onSnapshot with both turns
  C-->>U: answer replaces Thinking placeholder
